// ADR 0043 — NLL: mutation while a shared borrow is still live.
//
// Now:   REJECTED (for the wrong reason — borrow lives to scope end).
// After: REJECTED (for the right reason — `*r` is used after `x := 2`).
// The rejection must survive NLL; only the *diagnostic wording* changes.
proc main
    var x := 1
    val r := &x
    x := 2
    print(*r)